Package: leetlab-lab
Version: 0.1.2
Section: education
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: LeetCode Lab (local-first study tool)
Description: Native Rust LeetCode Lab desktop (NeetCode 150)
 Offline-first Solve/Learn/Practice/Trace with a bundled Temurin 21 JDK
 and a bundled GCC 11.4.0 C++ toolchain (Ubuntu jammy). No compiler
 installation, library setup, or PATH changes required; no browser
 engine, Node runtime, or listening HTTP server is involved at runtime.
 .
 Installs to /opt/leetlab-lab with a .desktop entry. Requires glibc 2.35
 or newer (any Ubuntu 22.04+ x64 system install satisfies this; user-space
 only, no root-owned toolchain files outside /opt/leetlab-lab).
